WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:24.800
Jonouchi survives Marik's attack and counterattacks with quick thinking.

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:30.530
But one step away from victory, Marik summons Ra.

00:01:30.530 --> 00:01:39.110
Will Ra's third effect - God Phoenix - burn Jonouchi's spirit along with his monster?

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:41.910
Please survive this, Jonouchi!

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:44.020
Victory is right before your eyes!

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:50.020
Jonouchi Dies

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:00.520
This must be a joke.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:06.320
If I lose, I'll never reach Mai or Yugi!

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:30.500
Jonouchi!

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:38.020
Burn him up!

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:40.840
Don't leave a single drop of his soul!

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:45.580
Jonouchi!

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:46.620
It's no good.

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:50.820
Jonouchi's spirit will be all burned up.

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:58.240
Big brother, Marik's going too far!

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:01.360
Jonouchi is really going to die!

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:05.880
I've now seen Ra's third effect with my own eyes.

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:08.170
You did well for a scrub.

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:09.370
Congratulations!

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:18.520
That's enough.

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:20.140
Return, Phoenix!

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:34.720
I can see his soul vanishing into the heavens as a wisp of smoke.

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:51.510
What?

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:54.510
Jonouchi!

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:02.020
No way!  He's still alive?

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:16.220
Yugi.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:21.350
Jonouchi!  We're in the finals!

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:23.460
Finals?

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:29.900
Oh yeah.  In my duel against Marik, I survived Ra's attack.

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:37.290
Monster Reborn's effect ended next turn, so Ra left Marik's field.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:43.290
Yes.  You summoned Gearfried next turn and defeated Marik.

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:47.530
Yeah!

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:51.030
Yugi!  It's time to fulfill our promise!

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:54.280
Let's duel, Jonouchi!

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:05.840
W-Why?

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:10.920
Is Jonouchi's emotional strength stronger than God's attack?

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:13.560
My... turn...

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:20.060
Impossible!

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:21.760
All right!

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:23.660
Way to survive, Jonouchi!

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:26.070
Ra is no longer on Marik's field!

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:29.600
If he attacks Marik, Jonouchi wins!

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.150
Jonouchi!

00:05:31.550 --> 00:05:33.810
He defeated God?

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:37.310
Jonouchi!  Draw a monster!

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:39.720
I draw...

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:48.800
Yugi.  I...

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:53.800
Gearfried...

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.460
I win.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:05.620
Attac-

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:08.100
Brother!

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:32.170
J-Jonouchi!

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:39.810
Humph.  How dare you make me work.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:47.550
Starting the count!

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:48.620
Wait, Isono!

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:50.880
Jonouchi!

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:53.040
Jonouchi!

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:55.310
Jono-

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:03.230
Jonouchi isn't breathing!

00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:07.740
No way!

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:12.740
Since Katsuya Jonouchi can't continue, the duel is over!

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:17.080
The winner of the first semfinals is Marik Ishtar!

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:21.310
Jonouchi!

00:07:21.310 --> 00:07:22.750
Brother!

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:25.760
Isono!  Call the medics!

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:27.630
Take him to the Battle Ship!

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:28.300
Yes, sir!

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:39.900
I can't believe he pushed me this far-

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:47.660
But he's gone.

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:48.980
Jonouchi!

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:51.200
Hey!  Jonouchi!

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:52.920
C'mon!  Wake up!

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:54.660
Wake up, Jonouchi!

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:55.540
Brother!

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:57.620
Answer me, Brother!

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.200
Brother!

00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:02.420
Jonouchi!  Wake up!

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:04.660
You punk!

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:05.920
Calm down, Honda!

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:07.430
Damn!

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:09.780
Where's the doctor!

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:11.770
He's on his way!

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:15.660
Dammit!

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:19.270
No way...

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:30.430
This can't be real!

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:36.120
Jonouchi, the way you lost...

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:39.930
I finally accept you as a duelist.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:48.200
Another is sacrificed to the darkness, vanishing from existence!

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:52.610
Be quiet!  Jonouchi isn't dead yet!

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:55.540
Whatever.

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:57.980
He will soon enough.

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:00.290
Marik.

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:04.790
Jonouchi efforts didn't go to waste.

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:06.290
At least for me.

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:13.300
Marik, you revealed too much in your duel against Jonouchi.

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:16.730
I saw Ra's effect.

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:23.310
And the key to defeating your God is hidden in this card.

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:26.760
Then good luck.

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:34.280
Hurry!  Take him to the medical room!

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:43.240
Brother!  Open your eyes!

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:44.660
Jonouchi!

00:09:45.170 --> 00:09:47.960
The second semifinals will begin in an hour!

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:52.570
Yugi!

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:57.710
Get over your friend's death and come to this duel field!

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:17.430
I'm waiting for you, Yugi.

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:40.800
Doctor!  How is Jonouchi?

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:43.570
He has signs of life.

00:10:43.570 --> 00:10:47.620
But to be honest, he's in critical condition.

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:49.700
Critical?

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:52.400
Is Jonouchi going to die?

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:53.820
No!

00:10:53.820 --> 00:10:57.400
Brother!

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:08.380
Huh?  Is this Domino City?

00:11:08.380 --> 00:11:10.040
Hey, Jonouchi!

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:13.650
Mr. Sugoroku!

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:16.150
We've been looking for you!

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:18.750
Quit wasting time!

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:19.310
C'mon!

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:20.660
H-Hey!

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:22.800
Where are we going?

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:27.690
Where?  To Domino City's Duel Tournament, of course!

00:11:27.690 --> 00:11:29.660
The City's Duel Tournament?

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:30.900
We have to hurry.

00:11:30.900 --> 00:11:32.980
The tournament starts soon.

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:34.460
You're right.

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.920
C'mon!  Hurry up, Jonouchi!

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:39.720
Or you'll have to forfeit!

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:40.540
R-Right.

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:43.340
Oh yeah.

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:47.600
I entered the city tournament.

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:52.050
Doc!  Do something!

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:55.060
I'll never ask for anything again!

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:57.820
Please do something, Doctor!

00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:00.020
Please help him!

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:01.560
I understand, but...

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:04.570
I don't know the cause.

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:06.630
There's nothing I can do.

00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:09.520
What?  Aren't you a doctor!

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:11.860
Your job is to cure the sick!

00:12:11.860 --> 00:12:13.310
Knock it off, Honda!

00:12:13.760 --> 00:12:20.300
Modern medicine can't do anything against the power of darkness.

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:25.170
There's only one small chance left.

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:30.080
The power of his will to live.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:35.120
Even if we know the cause, this equipment isn't good enough.

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:39.230
We need to take him to a hospital with better equipment now!

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:41.160
The Battle Ship can take him!

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:42.900
I'll talk with them!

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:43.800
Me too!

00:12:45.670 --> 00:12:46.810
Mokuba!

00:12:46.810 --> 00:12:48.550
Nice timing!

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:50.350
I heard what you said.

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:53.100
But this ship can't leave.

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:58.170
What?  How can you say that!

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:00.350
He may die!

00:13:00.350 --> 00:13:02.450
Who cares about dueling!

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:05.660
It's not that.  The ship can't fly.

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:07.180
Can't fly?

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:10.120
The engines aren't working.

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:10.830
What?

00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:20.370
When we escaped from Noa's base, the explosion damaged the engines.

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:26.550
We managed to arrive at Alcatraz, but the engines broke.

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:28.080
No way...

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:30.160
But don't worry!

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:34.090
I'll contact Kaiba Corporation to send a helicopter!

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:36.520
Thanks, Mokuba.

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:38.970
But don't tell my brother.

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:50.170
Jonouchi...

00:13:50.820 --> 00:13:55.170
Don't die, Jonouchi!

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:57.700
Jonouchi!

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:01.320
Partner...

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:15.160
Jonouchi...  If you die, I...

00:14:22.060 --> 00:14:24.840
I can no longer fight.

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:26.980
Jonouchi...

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:37.600
Yugi, when I keep winning and become a true duelist, I want you to duel me again.

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:40.570
Okay.

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:43.090
Let's duel when that time comes, Jonouchi.

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:49.100
My goal in Battle City was to fulfill that promise.

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:57.720
Compared to the promise with my friend, my lost memories and God Cards are worth nothing!

00:14:57.720 --> 00:14:59.850
But did I...

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:06.610
Did I sacrifice Jonouchi for them?

00:15:06.820 --> 00:15:08.850
My other self...

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:19.560
My hatred towards Marik is my only motivation to fight!

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:27.180
But what can come after that?

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:32.770
Here I go!  Flame Swordsman!

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:34.740
Attack Holograh!

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:44.480
All right!  I won!

00:15:46.260 --> 00:15:49.400
Oh yeah.  The city duel tournament.

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:55.780
That's when I started on my path to becoming a true duelist.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.060
But...

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:00.170
But Yugi...

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:02.740
Please, Jonouchi...

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:05.740
Please don't die.

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:11.540
What's a true duelist?

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:15.550
Jonouchi?

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:29.700
This is...

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:31.960
The Millennium Necklace!

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:36.200
The Millennium Item that Ishizu gave us!

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:40.710
This belongs to you.

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:45.210
Ishizu said the Millennium Necklace was losing its power.

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:48.710
Why is it glowing now?

00:16:57.860 --> 00:17:01.530
Yugi!  Our Battle City isn't over!

00:17:01.860 --> 00:17:02.740
Right!

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.240
Duel!

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:09.540
What did I see?

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:15.240
The Millennium Necklace should've lost its power, but did it show our future?

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:19.550
The second semifinals will begin soon.

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:23.600
Duelists, come to the Duel Tower's stage.

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:34.060
Jonouchi, I'll believe in this future!

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:41.170
And I'll fight as a true duelist!

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:42.800
This is Mokuba!

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:45.370
Come in, Kaiba Corporation!

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:46.960
Can you hear me?

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:49.210
Send a helicopter to Alcatraz!

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:52.180
Dammit!  What's going on?

00:17:52.660 --> 00:17:58.750
The missile explosion is temporarily interfering with the radio signals.

00:18:00.270 --> 00:18:01.550
This is Mokuba!

00:18:01.550 --> 00:18:03.520
Come in, Kaiba Corporation!

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:07.920
Brother...

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:16.170
Yugi...

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:30.330
Yugi...

00:18:32.100 --> 00:18:33.620
Jonouchi...

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:37.060
I'm going to meet Kaiba at the Duel Ring.

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:38.440
Yugi...

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:45.600
So Jonouchi, you keep fighting as a duelist!

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:51.950
Everyone, look after Jonouchi.

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:54.160
Yugi!

00:18:54.680 --> 00:18:56.410
Wait up, Yugi!

00:18:56.660 --> 00:18:59.910
The duel is more important than Jonouchi?

00:19:00.300 --> 00:19:03.920
What's the point of this battle?

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:05.820
It's not just Jonouchi.

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:12.900
Mai, Bakura and Rishido were all hurt and collapsed!

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:16.350
All we're doing is losing everyone!

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:17.920
Anzu.

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:23.100
I fight to fulfill my promise with Jonouchi.

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:23.940
Promise?

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:27.700
The Millennium Necklace showed me a vision of the future.

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:37.580
If I run from this fight, I'll never achieve that future.

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:44.590
Anzu, remember the tablet we saw at Domino Museum's Egypt exhibit?

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:47.360
Yeah.

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:51.600
What's this?

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:57.040
Why is Yugi on this tablet?

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:01.200
Anzu.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:04.880
I now know who I am.

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:12.110
The spirit of the ancient Egyptian Pharaoh that lives inside the Millennium Puzzle.

00:20:12.320 --> 00:20:14.620
That's who I am!

00:20:15.240 --> 00:20:19.520
My soul should've been lost long ago.

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:23.530
But I exist in present times.

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:27.530
In order to regain what I lost!

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:36.540
As long as a person keeps searching for an answer, there's a place he'll return to.

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:38.740
Jonouchi will return.

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:44.000
He will come back to us, happy as always!

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:46.550
I believe this future will occur!

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:48.600
Win, Yugi!

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:51.600
Yes.  With Jonouchi by my side.

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:52.560
Good luck!

00:20:58.620 --> 00:21:02.020
But if Yugi loses...

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:03.970
I'll be...

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:20.750
Jonouchi, I will fight.

00:21:21.860 --> 00:21:24.720
To make our promise come true.

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:28.490
So don't give up, Jonouchi.

00:21:32.230 --> 00:21:36.860
Until the day we fight as true duelists!

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:49.060
Believing his future with Jonouchi, Yugi enters the Duel Ring against Kaiba.

00:21:49.060 --> 00:21:56.230
To learn what road lies beyond Battle City, they will battle in this duel of destiny.

00:21:56.230 --> 00:22:00.300
Yugi's Slifer and Kaiba's Obelisk.

00:22:00.300 --> 00:22:02.860
These two Gods will fight here.

00:22:02.860 --> 00:22:06.960
Their battle begins with their pride on the line!

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:11.100
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Coliseum in the Sky
Yugi vs Kaiba

00:22:11.100 --> 00:22:12.660
Duel, standby!

00:22:15.390 --> 00:22:23.290
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:23.290 --> 00:22:32.230
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:32.570 --> 00:22:37.210
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:41.180
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:41.610 --> 00:22:49.150
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:49.150 --> 00:22:52.720
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:52.720 --> 00:22:57.490
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:57.490 --> 00:23:07.600
And walk it without stopping

00:23:07.600 --> 00:23:15.210
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:15.440 --> 00:23:24.180
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:24.180 --> 00:23:32.160
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:32.160 --> 00:23:42.000
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
